[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]
Local 2-player co-op and versus split the screen [b]top/bottom[/b], which leaves each player a thin, very wide strip on wide and ultrawide monitors. This mod splits it [b]side by side[/b] instead: Player 1 on the left, Player 2 on the right. Each player's HUD is moved into their own half.

[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/dynastywarriors3completeeditionremastered/mods/7]UE4SS[/url] first: [i]dwmapi.dll[/i] and the [i]ue4ss[/i] folder go next to [i]DW3CE_RE\Binaries\Win64\DW3CE_RE-Win64-Shipping.exe[/i].
[*]Extract this archive into [i]DW3CE_RE\Binaries\Win64[/i]. You should end up with:
[i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit\Scripts\main.lua[/i]
[i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit\enabled.txt[/i]
[*]Start a 2-player battle. The split is side by side straight away.
[/list]
[b]Uninstall:[/b] delete the [i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit[/i] folder.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Side-by-side split[/b] for local co-op and versus.
[*][b]HUD follows the split[/b]: each player's health, musou, officer gauge, morale, minimap and K.O. counter are moved into that player's half.
[*][b]Switch the split[/b] between side-by-side and the original top/bottom at any time, even mid-battle. The HUD follows.
[*][b]Per-player wider view[/b] (side-by-side mode only): each player can widen their FOV by 0-50%. It works on top of the game's camera, so musou zooms keep working. Cutscenes are untouched. In top/bottom mode both players always use the default FOV.
[*][b]Per-player HUD scale[/b] (50-200%) for the own HP gauge, the strong enemy's gauge and the minimap block, in both split modes.
[*][b]In-game settings menu[/b] on three keys, shown in the player's half of the screen.
[*]All settings are remembered between sessions.
[*]No game files are modified.
[/list]
[b]Controls[/b]
[list]
[*][b]F8[/b] - next setting (its name and value are shown on screen)
[*][b][ / ][/b] - change the selected setting down / up
[/list]
[b]Settings, in F8 order[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Split[/b] - side by side / top-bottom
[*][b]FOV P1 / P2[/b] - wider view +0-50% (side-by-side mode only)
[*][b]HP gauge P1 / P2[/b] - own HP gauge scale 50-200%
[*][b]Enemy gauge P1 / P2[/b] - strong enemy's gauge scale 50-200%
[*][b]Minimap P1 / P2[/b] - minimap block (with the morale bar) scale 50-200%
[/list]
Settings are saved to [i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit\settings.txt[/i]. Keys, steps and ranges can be changed at the top of [i]Scripts\main.lua[/i].
[b]Upgrading from 1.2:[/b] the separate hotkeys are gone. F8 no longer switches the split directly: it is now the first item of the F8 menu, changed with [b][ / ][/b]. Player 2's FOV keys [b]; / '[/b] are replaced by the menu item "FOV P2". Your saved split mode and FOV values are kept.

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/dynastywarriors3completeeditionremastered/mods/7]UE4SS for Dynasty Warriors 3 Complete Edition Remastered[/url]
[/list]
Tested on Steam build 25630985 with UE4SS v3.0.1-1152 (experimental) on a 21:9 monitor. Should work with other UE4SS Lua mods. If a game update breaks it, please post your game build and attach [i]ue4ss\UE4SS.log[/i].
Source code (MIT): [url=https://github.com/Vivoxti/dw3-vertical-splitscreen]github.com/Vivoxti/dw3-vertical-splitscreen[/url]

